{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The end is approaching, and the primary task is to escape with your daughter</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Reasonably plan resources: food, beverages, water, cooking ingredients Ensure that you and your daughter are in good physical condition.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/\u5c4f\u5e55\u622a\u56fe_2024-11-27_112656.png?t=1738864401\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Having a variety of weapons to choose from: melee weapons, pistols, shotguns, assault rifles And it can be customized and upgraded at the engineer's office.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/\u7a81\u51fb\u6b65\u67aa.png?t=1738864401\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/PENGSHEQI_BENTI.png?t=1738864401\" />*Faced with an endless stream of corpses, the level design will provide heavy firepower to help resist<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/ZHONGJIQIANG.png?t=1738864401\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/\u5c4f\u5e55\u622a\u56fe_2024-12-09_185750.png?t=1738864401\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>*Don't worry, the game will be adapted to English and currently provides Chinese screenshots.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search buildings and discover survivors. You can choose whether to accept them as teammates, which will affect the subsequent game story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/\u623f\u95f4\u5185\u90e8.png?t=1738864401\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>*Don't worry, the game will be adapted to English and currently provides Chinese screenshots.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Search every building as you like! Be careful, the interior of the building is full of unknowns, NPCs in need of help, enemies with bad intentions, etc......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can find supplies in the building, set up a workshop, create items, cook food, lie in bed, and more......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shelters can provide rest, crafting items, dodging the tide of corpses, etc....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/\u5c4f\u5e55\u622a\u56fe_2024-12-12_194804.png?t=1738864401\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>*Don't worry, the game will be adapted to English and currently provides Chinese screenshots.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Plan to create a trilogy consisting of three stories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Plan the game duration to be 8 hours+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Communication group: 733742575\u00a0 (Tencent QQ Group).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3321680?t=1738864401","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738864401","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/35ec4f50a115bce9524831ce30d11f9f0d7aa5ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738864401","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/35ec4f50a115bce9524831ce30d11f9f0d7aa5ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738864401","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The end is approaching, and the primary task is to escape with your daughter</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Reasonably plan resources: food, beverages, water, cooking ingredients Ensure that you and your daughter are in good physical condition.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/\u5c4f\u5e55\u622a\u56fe_2024-11-27_112656.png?t=1738864401\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Having a variety of weapons to choose from: melee weapons, pistols, shotguns, assault rifles And it can be customized and upgraded at the engineer's office.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/\u7a81\u51fb\u6b65\u67aa.png?t=1738864401\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/PENGSHEQI_BENTI.png?t=1738864401\" />*Faced with an endless stream of corpses, the level design will provide heavy firepower to help resist<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/ZHONGJIQIANG.png?t=1738864401\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/\u5c4f\u5e55\u622a\u56fe_2024-12-09_185750.png?t=1738864401\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>*Don't worry, the game will be adapted to English and currently provides Chinese screenshots.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search buildings and discover survivors. You can choose whether to accept them as teammates, which will affect the subsequent game story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/\u623f\u95f4\u5185\u90e8.png?t=1738864401\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>*Don't worry, the game will be adapted to English and currently provides Chinese screenshots.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"